4b:["$","p","f627f9dd4b30",{"className":"type-body my-4 font-medium text-foreground/70","children":["Because no one fully understood how all the systems interacted, every change felt risky. A simple tweak to fix one misroute often broke something else. Engineering had already â€œhad a hell of a timeâ€ getting BookIt to work with PDLâ€™s custom forms; any new request meant more tickets and more back-and-forth. Korey found himself spending weekly cycles with LeanData support without ever reaching a configuration that felt stable or explainable."]}]
